ractice eco-responsible agriculture and restore abandoned houses to facilitate repopulation. Everything should be idyllic except for their opposition to a wind turbine project that creates a serious conflict with their neighbors. The tension will rise to the point of irreparability."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Antoine et Olga, un couple de français, sont installés depuis longtemps dans un petit village de Galice.  Ils pratiquent une agriculture écoresponsable et restaurent des maisons abandonnées pour faciliter le repeuplement. Tout serait idyllique, si leur opposition à un projet d’éolienne ne faisait progressivement naître une tension avec leurs voisins."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/s6MaPYex76umGy9rcGjkyyYQdmS.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vlhzpgLDoiiMCNa3Jxj2VcuRAoD.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":848685,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/s6MaPYex76umGy9rcGjkyyYQdmS.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/s6MaPYex76umGy9rcGjkyyYQdmS.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/s6MaPYex76umGy9rcGjkyyYQdmS.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/s6MaPYex76umGy9rcGjkyyYQdmS.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bFG8bvzjYAaSuJ8dGJQ7qIXf7wl.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bFG8bvzjYAaSuJ8dGJQ7qIXf7wl.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sWTzVaZtseFaGxzeuDTbk5Eg1Eq.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sWTzVaZtseFaGxzeuDTbk5Eg1Eq.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{